# Secret files are mounted from this directory and are never committed.
# `.gitignore` excludes everything here except this file.
#
# Stage 0 expects:
#
#   postgres_password           password for the bundled PostgreSQL
#   database_url                postgres://reviewplane:<password>@postgres:5432/reviewplane
#   bootstrap_token             administrator bootstrap token
#   worker_credential           what the browser worker presents to the server
#   worker_command_credential   what the server presents to the browser worker
#
# The last two are deliberately different values: they are the two halves of
# the mutual authentication in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 11, and neither
# works in the other direction.
#
# Generate each with, for example:
#
#   openssl rand -base64 39 | tr -d '\n' > deploy/compose/secrets/worker_credential
